=== any with generator expression
any(x > 0 for x in xs)

=== all with generator expression
all(x > 0 for x in xs)

=== any with generator expression and condition
any(x > 0 for x in xs if x % 2 == 0)

=== any with equality comparison
any(x == target for x in xs)

=== any assigns to variable
found: bool = any(x > 0 for x in xs)

=== any with dict items tuple unpack
any(v > 10 for k, v in d.items())
